              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h3>Annotation</h3><table class=\"hl7__eu__lab__report\"><tr><th>Conclusion and Recommendations based on this report and previous findings known to us:</th></tr><tr><td>The patient shows a positive blood culture for Gram-positive organisms, indicating bacteremia. Oxygen saturation is mildly decreased, suggesting possible hypoxemia. Lactate is at the upper limit of normal, which may indicate early tissue hypoperfusion or sepsis. Findings are consistent with early sepsis; urgent clinical assessment and management are recommended.</td></tr></table></div>"
